# Navigation can disappear

On views that should show app chrome (Listen, Studio, Admin, and other
persistent-nav surfaces), the sidebar, drawer, bottom bar, or subtabs can
still unmount at any instant. Confirm the tree is mounted before asserting
a selected tab. If it stays gone there, that is a bug.

Do **not** apply this to surfaces that are supposed to hide chrome: the
full-screen player, expanded/full-screen audio editor (Pro Editor), and
other dedicated expanded canvases. Missing nav there is correct.

Details: root `AGENTS.md` Testing, `packages/tahti-web/AGENTS.md`,
`packages/tahti-web/NAVIGATION-SITEMAP.md`.
